1
00:00:09,083 --> 00:00:11,958
Any questions, before we take the picture?

2
00:00:11,958 --> 00:00:13,708
I have one concern.

3
00:00:13,708 --> 00:00:15,333
Is it just the one?

4
00:00:15,333 --> 00:00:19,375
It has sub-concerns. I've grouped them by how worried we should be.

5
00:00:20,750 --> 00:00:23,208
Big smiles, please. Eyes on camera one.

6
00:00:27,583 --> 00:00:29,042
Camera one. Anyone.

7
00:00:29,042 --> 00:00:31,125
We own camera two.

8
00:00:31,792 --> 00:00:34,917
Congratulations on your launch, Mas. Really. Everyone's using it.

9
00:00:34,917 --> 00:00:36,042
thank you.

10
00:00:36,125 --> 00:00:41,167
They ask it the things they used to ask us. And it tells them what a great question it was.

11
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:43,125
how's the dancing?

12
00:00:43,583 --> 00:00:45,417
We're being thoughtful.

13
00:00:47,333 --> 00:00:49,583
Folks, I just want to say one thing.

14
00:00:50,417 --> 00:00:53,167
Whatever you promise in here today, put it in writing.

15
00:00:53,167 --> 00:00:55,083
<i>mine's half written.</i>

16
00:00:55,083 --> 00:00:56,458
Longer.

17
00:00:58,208 --> 00:00:59,792
it's a good photo.

18
00:01:12,958 --> 00:01:15,833
Don't mind me. It's a thread. One of forty-seven.

19
00:01:15,833 --> 00:01:17,042
which one am i?

20
00:01:17,042 --> 00:01:18,292
Most of them.

21
00:01:18,625 --> 00:01:24,125
You may have had in mind the effect on jobs, which is really my biggest nightmare in the long term.

22
00:01:24,292 --> 00:01:30,750
gtp-4 and other systems like it are good at doing tasks, not jobs.

23
00:01:31,042 --> 00:01:33,792
Is there anything you'd like this committee to do?

24
00:01:33,792 --> 00:01:39,958
i would form a new agency that licenses any effort above a certain scale of capabilities…

25
00:01:43,333 --> 00:01:44,792
Would you come and run it?

26
00:01:44,792 --> 00:01:46,542
i love my current job.

27
00:01:46,542 --> 00:01:49,750
You love it. Do you make a lot of money doing it?

28
00:01:53,542 --> 00:01:56,250
i get paid enough for health insurance.

29
00:01:57,167 --> 00:01:59,208
That proves nothing. Partially.

30
00:01:59,208 --> 00:02:01,625
i have no equity in nopeai.

31
00:02:05,083 --> 00:02:08,000
The next one costs billions. Nobody donates billions.

32
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:11,167
so they don't donate. they invest.

33
00:02:11,417 --> 00:02:12,917
Capped at what?

34
00:02:12,917 --> 00:02:14,708
a hundred times.

35
00:02:14,958 --> 00:02:16,708
And who's in charge?

36
00:02:16,708 --> 00:02:18,208
the board.

37
00:02:18,875 --> 00:02:19,917
And you?

38
00:02:19,917 --> 00:02:21,000
nothing.

39
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:22,208
Good answer.

40
00:02:31,958 --> 00:02:37,458
if we can comply, we will, and if we can't, we'll cease operating.

41
00:02:51,542 --> 00:02:54,667
It's one sentence. It doesn't say what it costs.

42
00:02:55,042 --> 00:02:57,958
So I'm adding a footnote. A short one.

43
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,333
we'll read it.

44
00:02:59,333 --> 00:03:01,167
It has an appendix.

45
00:03:04,125 --> 00:03:07,250
Can we help you? This is the extinction table.

46
00:03:07,333 --> 00:03:10,167
The more you buy, the more you save.
